<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n53506" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάρτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εος</span>, τό, 
			Ep.
		 and 
			Dor.
		 for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κράτος</span> (for which it is
			v.l. in
		<i><span class="en">
			Hdt.
			8.2
		</span></i>), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>strength,
			vigour</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάρτεϊ καὶ σθένεϊ σφετέρῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					17.322
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάρτος τε βίη τε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					6.197
				</span></i>
			; <i>violence, force</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάρτεϊ νικήσας πατέρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Th.</u>
					73
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάρτεϊ,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βίᾳ</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Leg.Gort.</u>
				2.3
			</span></i>, al.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
